A||||5||fiero56||Beautiful day||||1||
Z||000000||fiero56||01-01-2000||06:40 PM||||It was a beautifull day today. High near 60, sunny, great day to clean the Fiero. Started at 10am, finished at 4, and man does it look GREAT! I didn't even get to the exterior yet. I'm so happy. I had to drive it. Pulled the sunroof off, and decided to take some old oil to autozone. I pulled in behind a good looking red '87-'88 coupe. I parked just accross the aisle from the guy. As he is getting out of his Fiero he does one of those double look things, and then just goes inside autozone. I didn't even bother to try talking with him(he ignored me when I waved). Then on my way home, I drive past a yellow '88GT parked in a neigborhood. Looked good, needed a bath though. Then I see an indy(without door decals). And lastly I saw a red '84-'86 coupe. Both indy and coupe were parked in parking lots. This is a record number of Fiero sightings in a day for me. I really need to print out some of Cliff's cards. <p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-01-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||87GT||01-01-2000||06:45 PM||||I think today was a great day too.  I cleaned my car in and out. I even took face plates off to clean behind them. I went to the store to get a manual and a man there pissed me off(see earlier post).  Anyways after I left I went driving through town and spotted a white 85-86SE cruising down a road.  I wanted to blow the horn at it but it was going away from me.  I think today was a great day for people to bring out their fieros.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||SCCA FIERO||01-01-2000||08:41 PM||||Not here in Utah. 20 degrees and thick fog. My Fiero hasn't moved for a month and I'm ready to drive it again. I'm going into withdrawls.||||reg||9
Z||000003||Phil||01-02-2000||12:27 AM||||Mine's still in the paint shop, 5 weeks and counting.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DXR_DAD||01-02-2000||07:09 PM||||I thought Al and I, here in calif. were the only ones with fun-n-sun. Fiero56 what's it like today? Both the fieros are clean and are running fine so today I'll go out to the pool and sit in the hot tub for a hour or two and think about what to do next with my 87coupe.<P>If I can get off this fourm!!||||reg||6
Z||000005||fiero56||01-03-2000||12:44 AM||||Today?<BR>Well, it got in the upper 50's but you never would have known it with the wind chill, very windy day today. Was cloudy and very overcast all day. Started raining later this afternoon and hasn't stopped. Supposed to get highs in the 20's later in the week. Dumb Ohio weather. I need to move south somewhere. <BR>The Fiero is very dirty on the exterior again, and school starts up tommorrow morning. Not going to get to clean it up for a while now. But I did finally fix my parking brake today. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
